                                <pre class="m-0 max-h-96 overflow-auto whitespace-pre-wrap rounded bg-bg p-3 text-sm">{a.body}</pre>
                            </article>
                        }).collect_view()}
                        {transcript.filter(|t| !t.is_empty()).map(|t| view! {
